# tally 2.2.1 P37, N7 (L §4.4 l.665: "An observation that fulfils the movement fixes its day", in every
# ledger): pay_w on window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07), fulfilled by a row of 2026-04-02: April's ledger holds the
# matched line, March's nothing of it (review g2 led/l2). Before W8: expected but missing in March, nothing
# in April.
=== l2.tally
model l2
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind promises: transfers uncertain
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input pay: money PLN
input w: date
input wl: date
input wo: date
input w2: date
input dd: date
input wu: date
move pay_w: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move pay_l: transfers
  on wl
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move pay_o: transfers
  on wo
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move pay_2: transfers
  on w2
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move pay_d: transfers
  on dd
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move pay_u: promises
  on wu
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  w = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "c"
  wl = window(2026-03-10, 2026-03-12) "c"
  wo = window(2026-03-15, 2026-03-17) "c"
  w2 = window(2026-03-28, 2026-04-03) "c"
  dd = 2026-03-22 "c"
  wu = window(2026-04-10, 2026-04-12) "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
version st
  cite card
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-10
  covers konto
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-03-12, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_l) "r2"
  bank[r3] = (on: 2026-03-19, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_o) "r3"
  bank[r4] = (on: 2026-03-30, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 60.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_2) "r4"
  bank[r6] = (on: 2026-03-24, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_d) "r6"
version st4
  cite card
  governs 2026-04
  known 2026-05-10
  covers konto
  bank[r5] = (on: 2026-04-02, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 40.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_2) "r5"
  bank[r7] = (on: 2026-04-11, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 40.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_u) "r7"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-04-02, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_w) "r1"
ask mar: residuals konto 2026-03
ask apr: residuals konto 2026-04
ask both: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04
=== expect mar apr
mar: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 move pay_d: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched pay_d on 2026-03-22: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +2 days
  2026-03 move pay_l: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched pay_l on 2026-03-12: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  2026-03 move pay_o: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched pay_o on 2026-03-19: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-06-20
apr: residuals konto 2026-04
  2026-04 move pay_2: model 100.00 PLN, observed 40.00 PLN, difference -60.00 PLN
    matched pay_2 on 2026-04-02: model 100.00 PLN, observed 40.00 PLN, difference -60.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  2026-04 move pay_u: model 100.00 PLN, observed 40.00 PLN, difference -60.00 PLN
    partly fulfilled pay_u on 2026-04-11: model 100.00 PLN, observed 40.00 PLN, difference -60.00 PLN, remainder 60.00 PLN: when does the rest arrive, or is it written off?
  2026-04 move pay_w: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched pay_w on 2026-04-02: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-06-20
warning: WARN-LEGS the two observations of pay_2 disagree: bank[r4] (60.00 PLN) and bank[r5] (40.00 PLN)
